OL,3,GNEWSATown clock hands removed for
OL,4,Arestoration
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town hall clock tower has had its
OL,7,Fhands removed for restoration work.
OL,9,FThe last time the clock hands of
OL,10,FMiddlesbrough Town Hall were restored
OL,11,Fwas 30 years ago in the 1990s.
OL,13,FSpecialists from Smith of Derby
OL,14,Fattached themselves to harnesses and
OL,15,Fleaned out of the clock face to remove
OL,16,Fthe eight pairs of hands.
OL,18,FManager Dean Allen said they were
OL,19,F"delighted" to take on the month-long
OL,20,Frestoration project to ensure the clock
OL,21,Fcan operate for years to come.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
